From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Willmer <info@jwillmer.de>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:53:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 095/110] Double, triple and Shift+click select in the preview

A double click selects the word under the pointer, by Unicode word
boundaries as in the editor; a triple click selects the whole paragraph,
list item, table cell or code line. Shift+click extends the selection to
the click.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

